# Run artefacts, never committed.
#
# import-state.json holds the tenant's real category/product GUIDs — this script's own
# record of what it created. It is per-tenant and per-run, it is what makes a re-run
# idempotent, and committing it would let a later run "resume" against ids belonging to
# a different tenant, silently creating nothing.
import-state.json

# `node fetch.mjs out` materialises 94 images (~31 MB); 9 of them exceed the repo's 1 MB
# check-added-large-files limit. assets-manifest.json is the committed proof of that set.
out/
